{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/AD_4nXd1EjIjS0mQQlDp5u5_c4gQXGcK4PGox_8QiWFDn0yEPO8jTjL_kiK5v9S_nqFZIPHbGmdj75gG1NnN6qRsc3hH4PGHMbyxeNPjP3rmvIAZJbSrKaTOVV4oHAbBJBbcNYlz6rsZfQ.png?t=1743009160\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/gif1finAL.gif?t=1743009160\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Witness an <strong>elaborately hand-drawn, action-packed epic</strong> inspired by the <i>FPS greats!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make use of the many <strong>devastating weapons in Wayne\u2019s arsenal</strong> and achieve <i>maximum destruction!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Explore</i> dangerous locales through <strong>8 humongous areas</strong> all across Orca Isle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HALF GAME, HALF CARTOON!</strong> Delight in the Captain\u2019s <i>depth-defying tale</i> in CAMPAIGN MODE as you <strong>view tons of animated cutscenes</strong> <i>exploring his adventure.</i>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a <strong>high-octane soundtrack</strong> that emphasizes <strong>AGGRESSION and CHAOS!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go for the gold in our <strong>ENDLESS MODE</strong>\u2013<i>how long can you survive</i> the onslaught?<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/AD_4nXcfKr5vquH2qViPAVZvvXQyozayPzpIY7YymnYyMwbn89xgui-ZlPjegEBzUBuQX7bsdKozm-pgS256obii8aNoTRhKdKUt9AM0eFQgNu19cvlBfFJ-JXGDUsn38u6AcvHgBQHI.png?t=1743009160\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/Waynimations.gif?t=1743009160\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <i>hot pink-wearing, fish-chomping, cigar-huffing</i> <strong>Captain Wayne</strong> refuses to let anything stand between him and his gory conquest to rob and humiliate every rich asshole around the globe. <br><br>After losing his arm in a terrible encounter with the legendary <strong>Vampire Whale</strong>, Wayne replaced it with his trusty shotgun, <strong>The Captain's Ol' Reliable</strong>, and sailed with it across the seven-and-a-half seas in his vessel, the <strong>S.S. Salty</strong>. <br><br>When an unexpected run-in with a group of evil mercenaries leaves him marooned on <strong>Orca Isle</strong> with his ship stolen, Wayne starts doing what he does best: <strong>annihilating everyone responsible.</strong><br><br><i>Equipped with a double barreled shotgun for an arm,</i> countless explosives, and a bad attitude, you\u2019ll have to go toe-to-toe with <strong>The Killer Whales</strong>, the most ruthless mercenaries in all the seven-and-a-half seas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DO YOU HAVE WHAT IT TAKES TO EMBODY THE CAPTAIN? </strong>\u00a0Let\u2019s find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/AD_4nXegRcWcn-ZW9vdCJr9xnRtOKsRBi9V6lEcoZSNIKudxWCkmCEiBBaeMtiQ3nQfdMvZUjt4DuIy2v7nJ3mBKLaxVeotusgCN4sJrdiE0NpsDZOq3yVqjPryu5bp2C0J4fi1e9bRFZQ.png?t=1743009160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/Gif3New.gif?t=1743009160\" />Mow down enemies with your <strong>double-barreled arm</strong>, rip enemies apart with devious <strong>chain-gun fingers</strong>, toss a bottle of the <strong>explosive Boom Brew</strong>, unleash the <strong>force of thunder</strong> from your palms, or <strong>PUNCH THEM \u2018TIL THEY\u2019RE PASTE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/Captain_Wayne_-_Fresh_and_Funky.png?t=1743009160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/AD_4nXd82n8IHdOgezAIbEdQ2zl_vRyLaU1tJVF46ks67s_exeSculY54IkoCpS9w30u8_QsMRyN4M_diTdzWIweQrWEmCGZVxp_DijRecRUW9s5PXK542CLMb1MXkd7BmHLFLuVXtV4.png?t=1743009160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Those Killer Whales bastards aren\u2019t gonna slaughter themselves! It\u2019s time to rob the rich to feed the badass.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2319790?t=1743009160","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743009160","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/1cb111792a50a689bf3ff37f50504c5bae3ddff2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743009160","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/1cb111792a50a689bf3ff37f50504c5bae3ddff2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743009160","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game features the ability to turn enemies into a globs of bleeding flesh via shotgun. On top of this, Wayne has a random chance of saying fuck, shit, or damn, at any given moment during the entire playthrough. We're sorry. It's just how he was raised."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2478030,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/AD_4nXd1EjIjS0mQQlDp5u5_c4gQXGcK4PGox_8QiWFDn0yEPO8jTjL_kiK5v9S_nqFZIPHbGmdj75gG1NnN6qRsc3hH4PGHMbyxeNPjP3rmvIAZJbSrKaTOVV4oHAbBJBbcNYlz6rsZfQ.png?t=1743009160\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img cl