ith it across the seven-and-a-half seas in his vessel, the <strong>S.S. Salty</strong>. <br><br>When an unexpected run-in with a group of evil mercenaries leaves him marooned on <strong>Orca Isle</strong> with his ship stolen, Wayne starts doing what he does best: <strong>annihilating everyone responsible.</strong><br><br><i>Equipped with a double barreled shotgun for an arm,</i> countless explosives, and a bad attitude, you\u2019ll have to go toe-to-toe with <strong>The Killer Whales</strong>, the most ruthless mercenaries in all the seven-and-a-half seas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DO YOU HAVE WHAT IT TAKES TO EMBODY THE CAPTAIN? </strong>\u00a0Let\u2019s find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/AD_4nXegRcWcn-ZW9vdCJr9xnRtOKsRBi9V6lEcoZSNIKudxWCkmCEiBBaeMtiQ3nQfdMvZUjt4DuIy2v7nJ3mBKLaxVeotusgCN4sJrdiE0NpsDZOq3yVqjPryu5bp2C0J4fi1e9bRFZQ.png?t=1743009160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/Gif3New.gif?t=1743009160\" />Mow down enemies with your <strong>double-barreled arm</strong>, rip enemies apart with devious <strong>chain-gun fingers</strong>, toss a bottle of the <strong>explosive Boom Brew</strong>, unleash the <strong>force of thunder</strong> from your palms, or <strong>PUNCH THEM \u2018TIL THEY\u2019RE PASTE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/Captain_Wayne_-_Fresh_and_Funky.png?t=1743009160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/AD_4nXd82n8IHdOgezAIbEdQ2zl_vRyLaU1tJVF46ks67s_exeSculY54IkoCpS9w30u8_QsMRyN4M_diTdzWIweQrWEmCGZVxp_DijRecRUW9s5PXK542CLMb1MXkd7BmHLFLuVXtV4.png?t=1743009160\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Those Killer Whales bastards aren\u2019t gonna slaughter themselves! It\u2019s time to rob the rich to feed the badass.</p>","developers":["Ciaran Games LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/1c91cb6095e634f8b8fcef6a2c4b2a1d46d613c5/header.jpg?t=1743009160","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<strong>Captain Wayne</strong> is property of <strong>Ciaran Games LLC</strong>. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256970536,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256970536/movie480.mp4?t=1743000328","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256970536/movie_max.mp4?t=1743000328"},"name":"Captain Wayne - Vacation Desperation Trailer #3","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256970536/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1743000328","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256970536/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743000328","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256970536/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743000328"}},{"highlight":true,"id":256934328,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256934328/movie480.mp4?t=1695180673","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256934328/movie_max.mp4?t=1695180673"},"name":"Captain Wayne - Vacation Desperation REVEAL TRAILER","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256934328/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1695180673","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256934328/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1695180673","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256934328/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1695180673"}}],"name":"Captain Wayne - Vacation Desperation","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<str